      "text": "```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                    OPERA — LANDSCAPE                             |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                                  |\n|  ORIGINS            BAROQUE          CLASSICAL       ROMANTIC    |\n|  -------            -------          ---------       --------    |\n|  Camerata           Opera seria      Gluck reform    Bel canto   |\n|  Monteverdi         (Scarlatti,      (1762)          (Bellini,   |\n|  1607               Handel)          Mozart's operas Donizetti)  |\n|                     vs.              fusion of seria  Verdi:     |\n|                     Opera buffa      and buffa        drama-      |\n|                     (comic)          (Le Nozze)       turgist    |\n|                                                                  |\n|  WAGNER             VERISMO          20th CENTURY    CONTEMPORARY |\n|  -------            -------          --------        -----------  |\n|  Gesamtkunstwerk    (Puccini,        Britten, Berg   Glass,      |\n|  Leitmotif system   Mascagni)        Strauss R.      Adams,      |\n|  Ring Cycle:        Everyday life    12-tone opera   Saariaho,   |\n|  15-hour tagged     instead of myth  (Wozzeck)       Adès        |\n|  musical discourse  Verismo grit     Prokofiev, Janac.           |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
