        "module": "theater-performance",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[opera]",
        "section": "theater-performance",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Opera",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Pergolesi's La Serva Padrona (1733): paradigm case.\n  A maid manipulates her master into marrying her.\n  Two singing characters + a mime; 50 minutes.\n  The \"Querelle des Bouffons\" (1752-54): a pamphlet war\n  in Paris about whether Italian buffa was superior to\n  French serious opera (Rameau). It was really a dispute\n  about Enlightenment values (naturalness vs. grandeur).\n```"
    },
